@backend_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Health Check
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Friendship Stats
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/stats
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get All Memories (Chronological)
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories
Accept: application/json

### 4. Search Memories by Keyword
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories?search=chai
Accept: application/json

### 5. Filter Memories by Mood
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories?mood=Adventure
Accept: application/json

### 6. Filter Core Memories Only
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories?coreOnly=true
Accept: application/json

### 7. Create a New Memory
POST {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Late Night Star Gazing",
  "date": "2026-10-24",
  "location": "Hilltop Viewpoint",
  "mood": "Adventure",
  "story": "Camped on the hill watching shooting stars and debating astronomy vs reality.",
  "insideJoke": "Don't drop the telescope!",
  "isCoreMemory": true,
  "imageUrl": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506744038136-46273834b3fb?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
}

### 8. Get Memory by ID
GET {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories/mem-1
Accept: application/json

### 9. Toggle Core Memory Status (Update)
PUT {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories/mem-1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCoreMemory": true
}

### 10. Delete a Memory
DELETE {{backend_HostAddress}}/api/memories/mem-sample-id
Accept: application/json
